{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-070":{"renderings":[{"id":"21e8b88ac43c505a","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-070"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"'Not limited to'; 'not just', 'not exclusively'."},{"id":"0fffc113efa7325e","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-070"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The grammar point 'Noun に限ったことでもない' typically expresses that something is not only limited to a specific instance or category. It insinuates that there are also other instances or categories involved. In English, it can be translated as 'not limited to', 'not just', or 'not exclusively'."},{"id":"d6542e85381dbc2a","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-070"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Noun + に限ったことでもない"},{"id":"d6b8db510acc4c6a","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-070"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Formal, literary \"not only limited to...\". (でも variant of n1-069's ではない.)"},{"id":"38b1bffd12f4b052","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"not-only-limited"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Not Only Limited To (Far From)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"not-only-limited"}}]},"n1-070#2a2fa74f98ea":{"renderings":[{"id":"c716eab32d5b5d4c","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-070"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The exam being difficult is not limited to just math."}]},"n1-070#69be37ebdbf1":{"renderings":[{"id":"9fd9c2b83b181d3a","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-070"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Her being cute is not just limited to her face. I also like her personality."}]},"n1-070#8eef4ad5ecf3":{"renderings":[{"id":"afa82d500207d6ba","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-070"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The occurrence of that problem is not limited to our country."}]},"n1-070#3f6c7b0e0a8b":{"renderings":[{"id":"f4f810cbd7739195","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-070"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The selling of this author's books is not limited to just Japan."}]}}}